  "body": "Positioned on the elevated north-east facing slopes of Paritai Drive, this exceptional property sits on Auckland’s most prestigious street. Set on a generous 1,196m² landholding, the property occupies a tightly held dress-circle location, surrounded by some of Auckland’s finest homes.\r\n\r\nThe existing residence of approximately 350m² offers comfortable living today while presenting exciting possibilities for the future. The home has been updated over time and provides a solid foundation for those wishing to further renovate and add value. \r\n\r\nThe layout includes four bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, plus powder room, (including a master suite with ensuite), along with multiple living areas that provide flexibility for family living and entertaining. A triple garage with internal access and extensive storage adds excellent practicality and convenience.\r\n\r\nFor those looking to create something truly special, this property offers significant potential to redevelop or design a bespoke new residence that fully captures the sweeping outlooks across Orakei Domain, Okahu Bay, Bastion Point, Rangitoto Island, North Head and the Hauraki Gulf.\r\n\r\nThe property is blessed by peaceful and exclusive setting. The location is exceptionally convenient. You can enjoy an easy walk to the waterfront, local cafes and shops nearby, proximity to Orakei Bay Village, and Auckland’s CBD is just 10 minutes drive away.\r\n\r\nOpportunities to secure a tightly held land holding of this size and position on Paritai Drive are incredibly rare. Whether you choose to enjoy the home as it is, enhance it further, or design a landmark new residence, this is a chance to secure a truly special piece of Auckland real estate. Arrange your private viewing and experience the potential of this remarkable property for yourself.\r\n\r\nViewings are by appointment only.",
